# INVWINSP.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: the split view
# of the locations.  Locations > Browse locations shows the tree beside
# the selected location's contents, loaded at once, the tree focused.
# Each arrow in the tree loads the contents of the location it selects
# once the selection has settled, before the next line runs.  TAB moves
# the focus to the contents, whose count, name and Record menu the
# status bar and tool bar then show; their keys move them alone, and
# Everything below (ALT-C G) shows this location only, the panel
# following.  ESC there gives the tree the focus, the contents kept
# until the tree moves, which shows everything below the location
# again.  ENTER in the tree opens the contents as a screen of their own,
# the split gone; what is set there is kept by ESC back to the split,
# the location still selected.  Parts (ALT-C P) in the contents opens
# the selected item's parts, whose ESC comes back to the split with the
# contents focused.  F6 and SHIFT-F6, TAB and SHIFT-TAB each give the
# focus to the other pane.  ESC in the tree goes to the item list; the
# end by Exit.
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINSP.SNP is its snapshot; TEST/splitchk.py
# checks it.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER ALT-L B
S LOCS
K DOWN
S A1
K DOWN
S B2
K UP
S A1BACK
K TAB
S PANE
K DOWN
S CDOWN
K ALT-C G
S HERE
K ESC
S ESCTREE
K DOWN
S B2AGAIN
K UP
S A1RESET
K UP
S OFFICE
K ENTER
S FULL
K ALT-C G
S FULLHERE
K ESC
S SPLITBK
K TAB
S BKPANE
K ALT-C P
S PARTS
K ESC
S PARTSBK
K F6
S F6TREE
K SHIFT-F6
S SF6PANE
K SHIFT-TAB
S STABTREE
K F6
S F6PANE
K ESC ESC
S ITEMS
K ALT-F X
